{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22520","headline":"简简吟 · 白居易","name":"简简吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苏家小女名简简，芙蓉花顋柳叶眼。\n十一把镜学点妆，十二抽鍼能绣裳。\n十三行坐事调品，不肯迷头白地藏。\n玲珑云髻生花样，飘颻风袖蔷薇香。\n殊姿异态不可状，忽忽转动如有光。\n二月繁霜杀桃李，明年欲嫁今年死。\n丈人阿母勿悲啼，此女不是凡夫妻。\n恐是天仙谪人世，只合人间十三岁。\n大都好物不坚牢，彩云易散琉璃脆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22520.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22520","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}